 ◈ Mixed scripts                                                                                                        
 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
                                                                                                                        
 日本語のテキストと English が混ざった段落です。مرحبا بالعالم — नमस्ते दुनिया. Emoji: 👩‍💻 🇨🇭 👍🏽 and a combining sequence:   
 café (decomposed) and café (precomposed). A cluster wider than a terminal cell: 𗀀ᩗ (a Tangut base plus a spacing Tai  
 Tham mark: one grapheme, three columns) and a zero-width space: a​b.                                                    
                                                                                                                        
 An unbreakable-token stress case: supercalifragilisticexpialidociousantidisestablishmentarianism                       
                                                                                                                        
